            <title>3.31.3</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:47:25 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>240</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.31.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Session search (`find-session`) now shows the title Canopy saved for a session, as the sidebar does. A session without one shows its first prompt or slash command. Search used to show a title the CLI generated inside the session, which could take on the style of your custom instructions. (#448)
]]></description>
