        <item>
            <title>3.31.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:37:05 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>239</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.31.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- When a Claude Code extension update fails to start, the message now shows the error type and the position in the extension's code, when the extension reports them. (#446)

### Bug Fixes
- Claude Code extension 2.1.331 can now be installed. Updating to it failed with "did not start in Canopy". (#444)
]]></description>
